  "playbook": [
    "Pick the primary category that matches the money keyword exactly; add secondary categories only for services the business really performs.",
    "List every real service in the Services section using the words customers search (from today's keyword list), with an honest description.",
    "Service-area setup for home-based businesses: hide the home address and list only the areas the business really drives to. Plan for the video verification walkthrough before you start: tools, vehicle, signage and proof you run the business.",
    "Build a review habit: ask every happy customer the same day with a direct review link. Never buy, gate or write reviews.",
    "Post weekly with real job photos (before/after) and seasonal offers tied to the surging keywords.",
    "Answer every review, good or bad, within 24 hours. It shows responsiveness and adds real service words.",
    "Keep name, phone and website identical everywhere (site, Yelp, BBB, Facebook, Apple Business Connect, Bing Places).",
    "Use the business's real name only. Adding city or keyword words to the name is a suspension risk.",
    "Track calls and leads with a tracking number set as the primary phone and the main line kept as an additional phone, so the profile stays consistent.",
    "For managed clients, request Manager access to the client's profile. The client stays Primary Owner and keeps control."
  ],
